WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.330
Now then,

00:03.330 --> 00:08.250
minus the First Unit Commander
Petrose Calamaria who is currently on tour,

00:08.250 --> 00:10.420
all Crimson Lords are present.

00:11.170 --> 00:15.790
I would now like to commence
the Seven Crimson Lords Conference.

00:19.080 --> 00:26.000
<b>A Roundtable of Lowlives</b>

00:19.670 --> 00:22.170
There is one single subject
up for discussion today.

00:22.170 --> 00:24.790
Namely, whether or not Terakomari Gandesblood

00:24.790 --> 00:28.630
is suitable for the position as
one of the Seven Crimson Lords.

00:29.460 --> 00:33.330
She has stacked up victory after victory
since being appointed as a Crimson Lord,

00:33.330 --> 00:35.670
and in the Lapelico Kingdom
battle the other day,

00:35.670 --> 00:38.080
she has accomplished her
tenth victory in a row.

00:38.080 --> 00:43.040
I am very impressed by
Terakomari Gandesblood's success.

00:43.040 --> 00:44.710
Whether domestically or overseas,

00:44.710 --> 00:48.170
her track record has also received
unreasonably favorable reputation.

00:48.170 --> 00:51.710
Right... if you only look at those results!

00:52.040 --> 00:56.250
Have any of you ever seen her fighting?

00:56.250 --> 00:58.130
No, I don't suppose you have!

00:58.130 --> 01:00.540
It is true that I've never
heard of her doing so!

01:00.540 --> 01:03.080
Crimson Lords are also a symbol
of the military arts!

01:03.080 --> 01:08.000
Pulverizing the enemy with the muscular
bodies we've built is our destiny!

01:08.000 --> 01:11.420
Do you understand something
like that, Lady Gandesblood?

01:11.420 --> 01:12.710
O-of course I-

01:12.710 --> 01:14.710
Yes, I believe that you do!

01:15.000 --> 01:17.500
The one who doesn't understand here
is you, Lord Metal!

01:17.500 --> 01:19.670
One who is truly strong will not make
an opponent of the weak!

01:19.670 --> 01:23.040
Lady Gandesblood is well aware of that!

01:24.170 --> 01:27.130
Ahem. Let's get back to the subject.

01:27.130 --> 01:28.830
As mentioned before,

01:28.830 --> 01:33.330
Lady Terakomari Gandesblood is
suspected of falsifying her true capabilities.

01:33.330 --> 01:37.380
Miss Gandesblood, do you have
an argument to counter this?

01:37.380 --> 01:39.920
Y-yes, I am the strongest.

01:39.920 --> 01:41.920
That is not a counterargument.

01:42.380 --> 01:44.790
And she has just given
more real evidence

01:44.790 --> 01:46.580
that she is not qualified
to be a Crimson Lord.

01:52.000 --> 01:56.040
Here is her report card from when she
was attending the Imperial Academy!

01:56.460 --> 02:00.920
As you can see, both Magic and Basic Physical
Education have the absolute lowest scores.

02:00.920 --> 02:02.790
Where did you get that from?

02:02.790 --> 02:07.500
It's easy enough to find out with
the power of the Mascarail family.

02:07.500 --> 02:11.580
In any case, you were
a hopelessly poor student.

02:11.580 --> 02:14.540
And what's more, you dropped out
of the academy, didn't you?

02:15.040 --> 02:17.880
In these three years,
what were you doing and where?

02:17.880 --> 02:19.250
Surely you weren't a shut-in, were you?

02:19.250 --> 02:21.580
Does it matter?

02:21.580 --> 02:23.960
You used your contacts, didn't you?

02:24.500 --> 02:27.460
Lord Gandesblood is a leading aristocrat.

02:27.460 --> 02:30.540
Something like getting his daughter
who lacks actual power and achievements

02:30.540 --> 02:33.380
appointed to the
Seven Crimson Lords is simple.

02:34.290 --> 02:37.000
You wanted to be popular no matter what, right?

02:37.000 --> 02:39.080
You wanted attention, didn't you?

02:39.080 --> 02:43.670
After all, this tasteless merchandise is
mass produced and widely sold.

02:43.670 --> 02:46.250
How could you do such a thing?

02:46.250 --> 02:47.920
What a shameless act.

02:47.920 --> 02:50.670
Is that really the truth?

02:50.670 --> 02:52.080
L-Lady Karen...

02:52.080 --> 02:53.920
Report card aside,

02:53.920 --> 02:58.250
is there any physical proof of
Komari wanting to be popular

02:58.250 --> 03:00.670
so she used her contacts
to become a Crimson Lord?

03:00.670 --> 03:01.880
W-well...

03:01.880 --> 03:05.040
You probably can't read
other people's minds.

03:05.040 --> 03:07.080
If you're going to call a Seven Crimson Lords
Conference into session

03:07.080 --> 03:08.920
and hold an impeachment,

03:08.920 --> 03:11.330
then you should do more thorough research.

03:11.330 --> 03:14.710
There's a valid point in
what you said, Lady Karen...

03:15.040 --> 03:18.000
However, it is certain that
Terakomari Gandesblood

03:18.000 --> 03:21.790
does not exhibit the capabilities
appropriate for a Crimson Lord!

03:22.250 --> 03:25.540
We were the one who had the final say
on Komari's Crimson Lord induction

03:25.540 --> 03:28.960
in the first place,
so what you're saying is-

03:28.960 --> 03:31.250
Your Majesty, it's all right.

03:34.250 --> 03:37.920
Chatter on as much as you like,
Flöte Mascarail!

03:37.920 --> 03:39.830
No matter what the words of
a nobody may insinuate,

03:39.830 --> 03:41.960
it will fail to reach the ears of the mighty!

03:47.540 --> 03:51.000
Why'd I say that ?! Why'd I say that?!
Why'd I say that?!

03:54.210 --> 03:59.250
Miss Gandesblood, what kind of joke is that?

04:00.250 --> 04:02.790
If you're going to go that far
with your boasting,

04:02.790 --> 04:05.580
why don't we cross swords here?

04:05.580 --> 04:07.330
Everyone will understand if we do that!

04:07.330 --> 04:09.710
Whether or not you qualify
to be a Crimson Lord,

04:09.710 --> 04:10.880
and everything else too!

04:10.880 --> 04:13.040
J-j-j-just what I was hoping for!

04:13.040 --> 04:15.080
Bring it on, Flöte Mascarail!

04:15.080 --> 04:18.460
With my super amazing magic, I'm gonna
turn you into omelette rice ingredients

04:18.460 --> 04:20.960
in the blink of an eye and devour you!

04:20.960 --> 04:23.130
...Is what I would like to say, however,

04:23.130 --> 04:28.040
first of all, this is also a test on
if I'm qualified to fight you or not,

04:28.040 --> 04:31.290
and it seems my maid Villhaze will be
your opponent for that one!

04:31.290 --> 04:32.630
You've got this, Vill!

04:32.630 --> 04:33.290
No, thank you.

04:35.920 --> 04:37.790
...And that is her opinion on that,

04:37.790 --> 04:40.130
so looks like we'll have to
cross swords another day.

04:41.170 --> 04:44.330
Stop freakin' messing with me!

04:46.170 --> 04:49.750
Well then, I would now like to
decide on the course of action

04:49.750 --> 04:53.500
for Terakomari Gandesblood via
majority rule from the Seven Crimson Lords.

04:54.630 --> 04:59.420
Based on our exchange earlier,
there isn't a fool here

04:59.420 --> 05:02.580
who would still think that she qualifies
to be a Crimson Lord, right?

05:02.580 --> 05:04.330
Th-there's one right here!

05:06.540 --> 05:08.290
Thanks, Sakuna.

05:08.290 --> 05:11.210
Your kindness is heartwarming.

05:11.210 --> 05:14.880
I too believe that she is qualified
to be a Crimson Lord!

05:17.000 --> 05:20.830
With this, the fate of Miss Gandesblood
has been decided.

05:20.830 --> 05:25.670
There are only two people who support you;
you know what that means, yes?

05:29.540 --> 05:31.210
Serves you right!

05:31.210 --> 05:36.380
Terkomari Gandesblood is not
qualified to be a Crimson Lord!

05:36.380 --> 05:37.500
Objection!

05:38.210 --> 05:42.210
I object! We don't have a majority vote yet.

05:42.540 --> 05:46.040
Where is this coming from?
You're nothing but a maid!

05:46.420 --> 05:48.330
There are two people who support

05:48.330 --> 05:50.540
Lady Komari's staying in
the Seven Crimson Lords.

05:50.540 --> 05:52.170
We know that.

05:52.170 --> 05:56.380
But the number of people who are
against her remains unclear.

05:56.380 --> 05:58.330
You know how many there are!

05:58.330 --> 06:00.040
Three people! Three!

06:01.040 --> 06:03.420
They certainly didn't raise their hands,

06:03.420 --> 06:06.540
so we can't definitively say
that there are three.

06:07.040 --> 06:09.670
Those of you who think
Terakomari Gandesblood

06:09.670 --> 06:12.500
is not qualified to be a Crimson Lord,
raise your hands.

06:14.540 --> 06:15.670
Huh?

06:15.670 --> 06:19.130
Have a look, Your Excellency,
it's two against two, isn't it?

06:20.000 --> 06:21.880
Del, raise your hand!

06:21.880 --> 06:25.250
Miss Gandesblood pisses you
off too, doesn't she?

06:25.250 --> 06:28.880
Del! You couldn't seriously be
dozing off right now, right?!

06:28.880 --> 06:30.790
Wait, Lady Mascarail!

06:31.460 --> 06:33.710
Please excuse me, Lady Delphyne!

06:37.290 --> 06:39.380
She's dead!

06:40.250 --> 06:41.420
What?

06:44.210 --> 06:46.080
It's the devil!

06:46.080 --> 06:49.210
Ah, how could this be?!
This is the work of the devil!

06:49.210 --> 06:51.830
How can the devil possibly exist?!

06:51.830 --> 06:54.540
This was done by the terrorist, of course!

06:55.250 --> 06:57.380
I-I don't think this is the case...

06:57.380 --> 06:59.380
And what do you know?!

06:59.380 --> 07:04.330
Anyhow, we must investigate when,
where, and who killed Del!

07:05.000 --> 07:09.460
What do we do, Vill?
Why did this become a mystery novel?

07:09.460 --> 07:11.290
It truly is ridiculous.

07:11.290 --> 07:13.420
None of them even know
that I am the murderer.

07:14.830 --> 07:15.750
What?

07:15.750 --> 07:19.210
I poisoned Lady Delphyne before the meeting,

07:19.210 --> 07:22.170
since she would probably agree
to your discharge from office,

07:22.170 --> 07:24.250
and I propped her dead body up on the chair.

07:24.250 --> 07:26.830
There are no injuries apparent on her.

07:26.830 --> 07:29.380
This means she was poisoned or something.

07:30.080 --> 07:33.380
Well then, who do you suppose
this is the deed of?

07:33.380 --> 07:38.380
You know quite well who it is,
don't you, Lady Gandesblood?

07:38.380 --> 07:39.750
She does!

07:39.750 --> 07:42.290
There is no doubt that you killed Del!

07:42.290 --> 07:45.040
She also has reason to prevent a majority rule!

07:45.040 --> 07:47.290
Th-then show me the proof, why dontcha!

07:47.290 --> 07:49.630
If there's no proof,
that's just a false accusation!

07:49.630 --> 07:54.830
We believe that saying Komari is the culprit
is nothing more than conjecture... yes.

07:55.330 --> 08:00.790
Supposing that Komari did kill Delphyne,
We do wonder what you would plan to do.

08:01.710 --> 08:03.130
I'd do this!

08:04.000 --> 08:07.790
Miss Flöte, personal disputes between
Crimson Lords are forbidden.

08:07.790 --> 08:09.880
This is not a personal dispute.

08:09.880 --> 08:12.540
I'm proposing a formal war.

08:13.170 --> 08:14.670
A battle?

08:14.920 --> 08:16.080
Lady Karen.

08:16.080 --> 08:21.420
Two generals of the same country engaging
in battle is permitted by law, correct?

08:21.420 --> 08:22.580
It is.

08:22.580 --> 08:23.580
Is it really?!

08:23.580 --> 08:27.420
If you lose, Miss Gandesblood,
you will resign from the Crimson Lords.

08:27.420 --> 08:31.040
If I lose... ah, that's it.

08:31.040 --> 08:34.380
I'll do one thing that you ask me to.

08:35.790 --> 08:39.750
What's this? You wouldn't
turn me down, would you?

08:39.750 --> 08:41.580
O-o-of course not!

08:41.580 --> 08:43.130
I'm the strongest!

08:43.130 --> 08:45.750
Doesn't matter who I'm up against!

08:45.750 --> 08:47.250
I accept your challen-

08:47.250 --> 08:47.920
Wait a moment!
I accept your challen-<b></b>

08:47.920 --> 08:50.040
This is the result of us
going through the effort

08:50.040 --> 08:51.960
of gathering for a
Crimson Lords Conference?

08:51.960 --> 08:54.960
You are far too lenient, Flöte Mascarail!

08:55.330 --> 08:57.420
To put both Terakomari Gandesblood's

08:57.420 --> 09:00.920
and the new recruit Sakuna Memoir's
skills to the test...

09:00.920 --> 09:04.710
I propose we hold a "Crimson Lord's War"!

09:07.000 --> 09:08.380
What did you say?!

09:09.500 --> 09:11.460
A Crimson Lord's War?

09:11.460 --> 09:13.170
Now that sounds fun.

09:13.540 --> 09:14.790
Lady Karen?

09:15.670 --> 09:16.790
Very well!

09:16.790 --> 09:18.460
We grant you permission to do so!

09:18.460 --> 09:23.830
As you know, a Crimson Lord's War is
major entertainment for Crimson Lords!

09:23.830 --> 09:26.580
In order to make sure
the citizens are entertained,

09:26.580 --> 09:29.080
try to kill each other with all you have!

09:30.080 --> 09:32.040
Kill... each other?

09:43.380 --> 09:48.040
Maybe a Komari that bursts into bloom
in the summer sky...

09:49.250 --> 09:51.040
Neat, right?

09:51.540 --> 09:54.960
I used a metaphor to compare me
exploding to a firework.

09:54.960 --> 09:57.290
Lady Komari, please get up.

09:57.290 --> 09:59.380
Your dinner is ready.

09:59.380 --> 10:01.630
I've lost all emotion.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.790
It's over for me.

10:02.790 --> 10:05.920
The meal for today is
demi-glace hamburger steak.

10:15.040 --> 10:18.330
Do you think you'll be able to do
the Crimson Lord's War?

10:18.330 --> 10:20.000
Yeah, I'll do my best.

10:20.250 --> 10:22.540
But of course, I don't think I can do this!

10:23.500 --> 10:26.290
Why am I struggling so much?

10:26.290 --> 10:29.040
I don't even want to be a Crimson Lord.

10:29.040 --> 10:30.540
Then let me ask you:

10:30.540 --> 10:33.540
What kind of work would you
like to do, Lady Komari?

10:33.540 --> 10:35.540
I don't plan to find employment.

10:35.540 --> 10:37.960
I want to be a novelist.

10:37.960 --> 10:40.920
Speaking of, you wrote something new, right?

10:40.920 --> 10:41.750
Yeah.

10:42.710 --> 10:45.250
I gave the manuscript to Sakuna
after the meeting

10:45.250 --> 10:47.210
because I wanted her thoughts on it.

10:47.210 --> 10:50.790
I told her that it's something
a relative wrote for the time being.

10:50.790 --> 10:53.960
By the way, are you using
a pen name or anything?

10:53.960 --> 10:56.710
No, I'm writing under my real name.

10:56.710 --> 10:58.580
Is that another new story?

10:58.580 --> 11:01.880
Yeah. On the back of the first page,
I wrote my n...

11:02.210 --> 11:03.420
Oh.

11:03.420 --> 11:06.080
Then Lady Sakuna knows by now.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.960
Th-that's...

11:07.960 --> 11:08.960
"That's"?

11:08.960 --> 11:10.630
That's not good!

11:10.630 --> 11:12.040
Lady Komari...

11:18.130 --> 11:20.580
Big Sis Komari was amazing!

11:20.580 --> 11:23.540
She totally held her ground
against Miss Flöte.

11:23.540 --> 11:24.960
Thank you for the meal.

11:28.880 --> 11:31.630
Goodbye, I'll come back again soon.

11:35.380 --> 11:36.790
Dad...

11:37.710 --> 11:39.830
I'm doing my best.

11:39.830 --> 11:42.080
I will protect our family.

11:44.210 --> 11:47.210
D-darn it... I can't...

11:47.210 --> 11:49.750
I can't let her read it...

11:50.920 --> 11:53.500
Wait, Sakuna!

11:59.290 --> 12:02.170
Farewell, Lady Gandesblood.

12:02.960 --> 12:06.540
Perhaps you will be happy in God's kingdom.

12:10.330 --> 12:12.080
Miss Terakomari?

12:12.080 --> 12:14.670
My apologies for coming here all of a sudden.

12:14.670 --> 12:17.080
The manuscript I gave you yesterday...

12:17.080 --> 12:20.000
You're sopping wet!
Let's get you changed right away!

12:20.000 --> 12:21.670
You catching a cold would be
a serious problem.

12:21.670 --> 12:24.420
Oh, but my room is a little messy!

12:24.420 --> 12:28.750
It'd be great if you could avoid
looking around as much as possible!

12:34.130 --> 12:35.630
Seriously?

12:36.380 --> 12:39.710
Sakuna, I'm sorry but do you have
any other clothes?

12:39.710 --> 12:42.670
Wearing something with my face on it
feels extremely weird.

12:43.000 --> 12:43.880
Huh?!

12:50.130 --> 12:52.170
Y-you've got it all wrong!

12:52.170 --> 12:54.290
This isn't what you think!

12:57.290 --> 12:58.290
Sakuna.

12:58.920 --> 13:01.040
This room is incredible.

13:01.040 --> 13:02.540
It's full of me...

13:04.080 --> 13:05.920
I'm sorry.

13:05.920 --> 13:08.380
I... I...

13:09.000 --> 13:11.880
I just like you so much.

13:11.880 --> 13:13.830
So, you made merch?

13:13.830 --> 13:15.290
Yes.

13:15.670 --> 13:21.000
The fifteen life-sized Miss Terakomari dolls
are my greatest masterpieces.

13:21.380 --> 13:24.880
I make sure to greet and
converse with them every day,

13:24.880 --> 13:28.250
and treat them like they're
the real Miss Terakomari.

13:28.250 --> 13:29.790
O-oh wow...

13:29.790 --> 13:32.750
Well, everybody's got
their own thing, I guess.

13:32.750 --> 13:36.460
I've got a secret or two
I don't want to tell people.

13:36.460 --> 13:38.580
You mean that you write novels?

13:39.880 --> 13:42.210
Yeah, like that. You saw it?

13:42.210 --> 13:48.040
Yes. Your name was on
the back of the first page.

13:52.540 --> 13:55.500
But you know, after seeing this room,

13:55.500 --> 14:00.080
I don't really care that she
found out I write novels.

14:01.920 --> 14:05.540
Miss Terakomari, I'm nervous.

14:05.790 --> 14:07.540
Is it the Crimson Lord's War?

14:07.540 --> 14:08.670
Yes.

14:08.670 --> 14:11.670
Everyone's really strong, and...

14:12.170 --> 14:14.960
a weak vampire like me

14:14.960 --> 14:17.330
would get killed instantly.

14:18.290 --> 14:22.880
Besides, I don't want to fight
with you, Miss Terakomari.

14:22.880 --> 14:25.380
Then we can join forces.

14:25.380 --> 14:26.250
Huh?

14:26.250 --> 14:28.500
If you and I work together,

14:28.500 --> 14:32.330
at the very least we'll have one less
opponent and one more ally.

14:32.750 --> 14:35.080
Don't you think that's a good idea?

14:35.080 --> 14:36.420
B-but...

14:36.420 --> 14:42.040
Why are you being so kind to me?

14:42.040 --> 14:45.750
Even though I look like...
I'm your stalker?

14:45.750 --> 14:46.880
Be...

14:48.290 --> 14:50.540
Because we're friends.

14:51.630 --> 14:55.380
It's normal for friends to
help each other out, right?

14:55.830 --> 14:57.330
Friends...

14:57.880 --> 15:01.330
Sorry! You wouldn't want to be
friends with me, huh?

15:01.330 --> 15:02.670
No, I would!

15:02.670 --> 15:04.880
Being your friend is an honor!

15:06.130 --> 15:07.960
I'm looking forward to our friendship!

15:07.960 --> 15:09.580
O-oh really!

15:09.580 --> 15:12.080
Same here, I'm glad we're friends!

15:12.790 --> 15:15.290
Friends, even after all this...

15:16.290 --> 15:18.460
She's my first friend.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.130
Oh, I know!

15:20.500 --> 15:23.380
Let's have Helldeus work with us too.

15:23.380 --> 15:24.460
Helldeus?

15:24.460 --> 15:27.580
He's a little strange, but I can trust him.

15:27.580 --> 15:31.380
Speaking of, you were at his orphanage?

15:31.380 --> 15:36.290
Yes. My family were all killed,
and he took me in.

15:36.750 --> 15:39.250
Oh, but I have family.

15:39.250 --> 15:41.630
You mean they were revived by the Dark Core?

15:41.630 --> 15:43.790
In that case, why were you in an orphanage?

15:45.790 --> 15:47.630
That's my family.

15:49.130 --> 15:52.880
My big sister was named Komari.

15:52.880 --> 15:55.880
Really? I do feel a strong
connection with you.

15:55.880 --> 16:00.960
Yes! She was so beautiful, and had
memories like the Delphinus constellation.

16:00.960 --> 16:03.420
Hm? What does that mean?

16:03.960 --> 16:07.880
I intuitively understand the shape
of someone's psyche.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.500
Are you cold?

16:12.500 --> 16:14.080
Your hands are icy.

16:14.080 --> 16:17.630
The Sapphire are a race
who have no body heat.

16:17.630 --> 16:21.540
That is due to having
a frozen, iron-clad body...

16:21.540 --> 16:23.290
W-wow...

16:24.420 --> 16:26.920
Will you come look at the stars with me?

16:26.920 --> 16:28.630
Sakuna? Wait...

16:28.630 --> 16:32.880
It's better to look at beautiful things
in your last moments.

16:33.460 --> 16:38.170
Ah, it's a Crimson Lord slaughter show
starring Her Excellency Terakomari.

16:38.170 --> 16:39.920
I simply can't wait!

16:41.000 --> 16:43.750
H-hey, aren't you in the seventh unit?

16:43.750 --> 16:45.210
Yes, I am.

16:45.210 --> 16:48.210
I belong to the sixth unit...

16:48.210 --> 16:50.130
What do you think of that?

16:57.540 --> 16:59.670
Anything for Lady Sakuna!

16:59.670 --> 17:02.330
Glory to Lady Sakuna!

17:03.380 --> 17:07.880
Day and night, those guys chant
"Lady Sakuna" as they kill each other...

17:07.880 --> 17:10.460
It's strange no matter how you look at it.

17:10.460 --> 17:14.080
Maybe that's just how popular
Sakuna Memoir is?

17:14.080 --> 17:15.630
That can't be right!

17:15.630 --> 17:17.420
Until a short while ago,

17:17.420 --> 17:20.460
that little girl was a nobody
who no one took any notice of.

17:22.380 --> 17:27.000
I can't help but be afraid
of Sakuna Memoir.

17:27.000 --> 17:29.790
She's not just your
run-of-the-mill Crimson Lord,

17:29.790 --> 17:31.630
she's something much worse...

17:34.290 --> 17:37.710
It's calming to watch
the stars like this, right?

17:38.170 --> 17:42.000
It really is. Constellations are pretty.

17:42.000 --> 17:46.380
Your memory is arranged like
the constellations, too.

17:47.710 --> 17:49.460
Miss Terakomari.

17:50.960 --> 17:54.830
Why do you think terrorists
want to kill people?

17:54.830 --> 17:56.130
Huh?

17:56.540 --> 17:59.960
Maybe it's because they have to kill others.

17:59.960 --> 18:02.290
I suppose that could be true...

18:02.670 --> 18:05.500
If... and this is hypothetical,

18:05.500 --> 18:08.330
if your family were taken
hostage by a terrorist,

18:08.330 --> 18:11.460
and they threatened to kill someone else...

18:13.330 --> 18:16.580
what would you do, Miss Terakomari?

18:16.580 --> 18:17.880
Kill the terrorist.

18:17.880 --> 18:19.080
Huh?

18:20.290 --> 18:23.960
The terrorist who is holding the family
captive is in the wrong, aren't they?

18:23.960 --> 18:26.460
If they're done away with
the problem is solved.

18:27.500 --> 18:29.250
How courageous.

18:29.250 --> 18:31.920
If it were me, that sort of thing...

18:31.920 --> 18:33.670
What's wrong, Sakuna?

18:33.670 --> 18:35.880
Are you in pain?

18:35.880 --> 18:36.960
Hey...
Please look up at the sky.<b></b>

18:36.960 --> 18:38.290
Please look up at the sky.

18:39.210 --> 18:41.210
It will all be over soon...

18:45.540 --> 18:46.580
Lady Komari.

18:47.290 --> 18:48.830
It's about time we head home.

18:48.830 --> 18:51.330
When'd you get there?!
It's kinda like a horror movie!

18:51.330 --> 18:52.920
You have to work tomorrow as well.

18:52.920 --> 18:55.830
You won't be able to wake up
if you stay up all night.

18:56.710 --> 18:58.000
Bye, Sakuna.

18:58.000 --> 19:00.960
I'm counting on you for
the Crimson Lord's War.

19:00.960 --> 19:01.920
Okay.

19:01.920 --> 19:04.080
Goodnight, Miss Terakomari.

19:04.420 --> 19:06.130
Yeah, g'night!

19:19.630 --> 19:22.080
What the heck?
That kinda hurt, you know.

19:22.080 --> 19:23.750
My apologies.

19:23.750 --> 19:27.210
However, I think Sakuna Memoir
may be a little bit dangerous.

19:27.210 --> 19:30.830
Nah, you seem way more dangerous
in my opinion.

19:30.830 --> 19:33.920
I felt bloodlust around us.
It was just a trace of it, but...

19:33.920 --> 19:35.750
You're imagining things.

19:41.130 --> 19:43.000
Why didn't you kill her?

19:43.000 --> 19:45.130
Sakuna Memoir...

19:45.130 --> 19:47.880
You must do what you can when you can.

19:47.880 --> 19:50.670
That is the motto of Inverse Moon.

19:50.670 --> 19:52.420
I-I'm sorry...

19:52.420 --> 19:54.710
You must be punished for this.

19:54.710 --> 19:56.960
How many people were in your family?

19:56.960 --> 19:58.210
U-um...

19:58.210 --> 20:00.540
How many people?! Answer me!

20:00.540 --> 20:02.500
Th-three people!

20:02.500 --> 20:04.540
My father, my mother, and my elder sister...

20:04.540 --> 20:06.630
Then I'll kill them all.

20:06.630 --> 20:11.290
Every time you mess up,
I will kill them all with a ritual article.

20:11.290 --> 20:13.630
If you don't want to lose your family,

20:13.630 --> 20:16.460
make sure you slaughter
those Crimson Lords.

20:16.960 --> 20:21.040
You know that at least one of the Crimson Lords
knows the location of the Dark Core.

20:21.040 --> 20:26.500
With your Core Implosion, you'll peek into their
memories one by one and find out where it is.

20:26.500 --> 20:27.580
B-but...

20:27.580 --> 20:31.420
Right, you don't stand a chance
against any of them,

20:31.420 --> 20:33.960
and that's why I prepared a gift.

20:33.960 --> 20:34.790
Huh?

20:34.790 --> 20:38.630
Take a look at your beloved Terakomari doll.

20:40.920 --> 20:43.080
It's Cornelius' secret recipe.

20:43.080 --> 20:45.170
I think you've at least heard of it.

20:46.630 --> 20:49.500
I have high expectations of you,
Sakuna Memoir.

20:49.880 --> 20:54.630
Even if it goes wrong, don't make
the same mistakes as Millicent Bluenight.

20:54.630 --> 20:57.460
Okay, I understand.

20:57.460 --> 20:59.290
I wish you the best of luck.

21:10.830 --> 21:12.250
I can't breathe...

21:12.250 --> 21:13.670
It hurts...

21:13.670 --> 21:15.380
I wish I were dead.

21:15.380 --> 21:18.500
Why is it only me who's suffering like this?

21:19.130 --> 21:22.790
Don't make the same mistakes
as Millicent Bluenight.

21:23.540 --> 21:25.380
Millicent...

21:27.790 --> 21:32.380
There are some things in common
since we're both vampires...

21:33.000 --> 21:37.790
But I never really had any contact with her
while in Inverse Moon.

21:44.630 --> 21:46.670
She isn't here.

21:47.040 --> 21:49.710
I wonder what that blue girl
is doing right now...

22:02.920 --> 22:05.750
What are you up to, Sakuna Memoir?

22:20.170 --> 22:21.790
Have a seat.

22:22.130 --> 22:24.960
You want to speak with me, right?

23:58.580 --> 24:01.000
<b>The Scarlet Stage</b>

23:58.830 --> 24:00.460
"The Scarlet Stage."
